WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,340
I'll pay it back. I'll make up for the singing this time.

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,420
Use your most serious hosting gun at usual concerts

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,580
Read it again. Who is lazy today and who is not guilty?

4
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,070
Good evening, dear viewers.

5
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:14,550
Here are tonight’s most important survival rules:

6
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:16,390
Who is lazy and who is not guilty?

7
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:18,430
One more thing, thanks to Boss Su for sponsoring

8
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:19,390
Don't drag me into this

9
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,920
Have I come to the wrong place?

10
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,600
Did you tell me about the sanitary products before?

11
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,600
No, it was Xue Ya who threw the pot to me.

12
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,160
I didn't even know you had those things

13
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,800
Then why didn't you refute it then?

14
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:31,760
I retorted

15
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,260
Who believes me

16
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:36,000
Don't interrogate people here without evidence.

17
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,160
But after that incident

18
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,600
Xue Ya was the first to put the blame on her head.

19
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,600
So we should look at the evidence more

20
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,720
Xue Yam wronged her

21
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,560
It doesn't mean that if you are wronged again, it will become fair.

22
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,680
I can understand that you don't believe it

23
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,640
If it were me, I would doubt it too

24
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,400
But where will I go with whatever I do in the future?

25
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:49,560
You can say it face to face

26
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:52,420
I will never pry for anyone again.

27
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:54,140
Then let me talk about the finished product first.

28
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:55,380
This is really useful

29
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:57,980
If it breaks, take it back and I'll give you the repair bill.
